#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.GENERIC"
