msgstr "Mam ochotę coś ugotować."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTLIGHT"
msgid "I love seeing the forest lit up at night."
msgstr "Uwielbiam patrzeć na rozświetlony las nocą."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNING"
