#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP.GENERIC"
