msgstr "%s wygląda poważnie. I ostro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "You're supposed to put fires out when you're finished."
