msgstr "Nie przeszłam eliminacji."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.ANNOUNCE_SACREDCHEST_YES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.ANNOUNCE_SACREDCHEST_YES"
msgid "Huh. Guess I'm worthy."
msgstr "Zasłużyłam."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.ANNOUNCE_SHELTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.ANNOUNCE_SHELTER"
msgid "Ah, that's better."
msgstr "Ach, od razu lepiej."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.ANNOUNCE_SNARED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.ANNOUNCE_SNARED"
