msgstr "Co to, to nie!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.ANNOUNCE_TOOL_SLIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.ANNOUNCE_TOOL_SLIP"
